WEBVTT

00:14.700 --> 00:17.500
♪The Upper Three hold the seals♪

00:17.540 --> 00:21.380
♪A valiant general, an opera star, and a ruthless cripple♪

00:21.980 --> 00:24.420
♪The Middle Three stir the clouds♪

00:24.500 --> 00:29.140
♪A fiend, a wandering hero, and a master of the blade♪

00:30.540 --> 00:33.220
♪The Lower Three deal in gold♪

00:33.540 --> 00:37.500
♪A beauty, a seer, and a scholar♪

00:37.860 --> 00:40.780
♪The Upper, Middle, and Lower Three♪

00:41.620 --> 00:49.300
♪Represent the nine houses of old Changsha♪

00:49.900 --> 00:51.380
♪Together, they are known♪

00:52.060 --> 00:56.660
♪As the Mystic Nine♪

01:25.660 --> 01:31.900
[Mystic Nine]
[Adapted from the novel of Kennedy Xu]

01:32.060 --> 01:34.980
[Episode 10]
[This story is purely fictional]

02:10.440 --> 02:11.380
Child,

02:12.320 --> 02:14.020
your obsession runs deep.

02:15.470 --> 02:16.740
Even as death closes in,

02:17.080 --> 02:18.060
what weighs most on your heart

02:18.080 --> 02:19.610
is still the Huo Clan.

02:21.150 --> 02:22.490
Do you feel

02:23.360 --> 02:25.130
that you and everyone you care about

02:25.790 --> 02:27.540
have all been used as pawns?

02:28.760 --> 02:30.060
That no matter how hard you struggle,

02:30.080 --> 02:31.660
there is no escape?

02:32.960 --> 02:35.020
You can only watch helplessly

02:36.000 --> 02:38.320
as this clan, ruled by women,

02:38.640 --> 02:39.890
falls into decline.

02:41.510 --> 02:43.340
You resent that,

02:44.280 --> 02:45.090
don't you?

02:49.510 --> 02:50.450
Listen carefully, all of you.

02:51.000 --> 02:52.340
From now on, anything that happens here

02:52.400 --> 02:52.770
and anything you hear

02:53.110 --> 02:54.090
could be false.

02:54.510 --> 02:55.980
Master, then what about your words?

02:56.000 --> 02:56.490
Quiet.

02:56.910 --> 02:57.740
Remember what I said.

03:01.120 --> 03:02.180
Master, look.

03:02.750 --> 03:03.620
There's a crack here.

03:07.310 --> 03:09.370
It might lead outside.

03:17.440 --> 03:18.210
I remember this place.

03:19.590 --> 03:20.060
This is where

03:20.080 --> 03:21.210
Tu flew out before.

03:23.120 --> 03:24.650
But the opening is too small and the wall too thick.

03:25.670 --> 03:26.570
No one can get through.

03:27.000 --> 03:27.370
Master,

03:28.030 --> 03:29.060
you keep looking for another way.

03:29.560 --> 03:30.420
I'll dig here.

03:31.030 --> 03:31.620
You know

03:32.000 --> 03:33.130
I'm especially good at digging.

03:33.510 --> 03:33.930
No.

03:34.870 --> 03:35.770
From this moment on,

03:36.790 --> 03:37.650
none of us

03:38.000 --> 03:39.060
is allowed to go off alone.

03:41.280 --> 03:42.010
This opening won't work.

03:42.750 --> 03:43.540
Let's keep moving.

03:43.870 --> 03:44.500
Yes.

03:56.590 --> 03:57.100
Master,

03:59.400 --> 04:00.610
there's a larger crack here.

04:03.710 --> 04:04.780
Give me some time, Master.

04:05.000 --> 04:06.100
I'll see if I can dig it open.

04:07.430 --> 04:07.850
Aolie.

04:08.240 --> 04:08.570
Coming.

04:46.270 --> 04:46.700
Master.

04:55.120 --> 04:56.700
Master, I'm small.

04:56.870 --> 04:57.490
I'll crawl in.

04:58.680 --> 04:59.170
Wait.

04:59.920 --> 05:00.580
The shadow could

05:00.600 --> 05:01.700
be hiding in cracks like this.

05:03.160 --> 05:04.020
We can't rush in.

05:04.480 --> 05:06.540
Master, if we're afraid of everything,

05:06.560 --> 05:07.810
we'll be trapped here until we die.

05:08.830 --> 05:09.700
I'll be careful.

05:14.600 --> 05:15.220
Be careful.

05:20.630 --> 05:21.290
Master!

05:22.870 --> 05:24.250
Zhenyuan!

05:28.000 --> 05:28.930
Quick, help him out.

05:29.240 --> 05:29.580
Come on.

05:31.040 --> 05:31.660
Are you all right?

05:32.310 --> 05:32.810
What happened?

05:33.480 --> 05:34.100
Master,

05:35.270 --> 05:35.980
Tu...

05:40.800 --> 05:41.220
Tu,

05:41.950 --> 05:42.370
go.

06:01.070 --> 06:01.660
Impossible.

06:01.950 --> 06:02.460
Master,

06:03.070 --> 06:04.140
what is going on?

06:04.480 --> 06:05.140
This can't be right.

06:06.480 --> 06:07.700
Tu was alive just moments ago.

06:07.950 --> 06:09.250
It was moving in my arms.

06:11.630 --> 06:12.250
Come with me.

06:32.240 --> 06:33.370
We all saw

06:33.390 --> 06:34.980
Tu fly in from outside with the message,

06:36.000 --> 06:37.540
but the real Tu had been dead all along.

06:39.070 --> 06:39.850
So

06:41.510 --> 06:42.490
Master wasn't lying to us.

06:44.160 --> 06:44.780
Then...

06:45.680 --> 06:47.460
did we really die once?

06:48.560 --> 06:50.490
These murals look like the ones in Liunian Hall,

06:50.920 --> 06:52.020
but the central figure

06:52.830 --> 06:54.140
isn't the Otherworld Patriarch.

07:01.070 --> 07:02.050
Of the three tricks,

07:03.070 --> 07:04.370
only peering into the future remains.

07:06.070 --> 07:08.020
This trick will tell us

07:10.390 --> 07:11.660
whether we'll make it out alive.

07:12.510 --> 07:12.980
Master,

07:14.310 --> 07:15.410
this tower created

07:15.410 --> 07:16.250
a false Tu.

07:17.480 --> 07:18.100
We died,

07:18.120 --> 07:19.140
and you brought us back.

07:19.510 --> 07:19.900
Then...

07:20.600 --> 07:21.930
could we be fakes too?

07:28.640 --> 07:29.810
If this trick works,

07:31.080 --> 07:32.220
we'll see what the future holds

07:33.280 --> 07:34.220
and have our answer.

07:35.160 --> 07:36.250
If you are all fakes,

07:37.590 --> 07:38.490
I'll find a way

07:38.510 --> 07:40.020
to take this tower down with me.

07:42.950 --> 07:44.770
We decide for ourselves what's real.

07:47.360 --> 07:47.890
Do it.

07:49.000 --> 07:49.600
Master,

07:50.430 --> 07:52.410
if something goes wrong with this trick,

07:52.880 --> 07:53.890
will something terrible happen?

07:54.270 --> 07:55.130
Could we end up

07:56.520 --> 07:58.130
like those dried corpses in Liunian Hall?

08:01.750 --> 08:02.580
If someone has to try it,

08:02.870 --> 08:03.490
let it be me.

08:03.750 --> 08:04.750
- I'll do it! - I'll do it!

08:04.780 --> 08:05.780
- Master, let me do it! - I'll do it!

08:05.800 --> 08:06.260
Enough.

08:08.280 --> 08:09.770
No one understands what has happened here

08:09.790 --> 08:10.730
better than I do.

08:12.510 --> 08:14.090
Only I can perform this trick.

08:18.680 --> 08:20.130
You just want me to perform

08:20.150 --> 08:21.170
all three tricks, don't you?

08:24.270 --> 08:24.900
Fine.

08:26.680 --> 08:27.900
I'll give you what you want.

08:29.870 --> 08:31.250
I'll give you what you want.

08:32.270 --> 08:34.220
I'd like to see what else you can throw at me.

09:03.270 --> 09:04.100
I see...

09:22.000 --> 09:22.420
This way.

09:22.440 --> 09:22.820
Yes.

09:31.200 --> 09:31.980
Something's wrong with him.

09:32.670 --> 09:33.220
Wake him up.

09:38.110 --> 09:38.710
Master.

09:42.240 --> 09:42.730
Master.

09:44.200 --> 09:45.770
Master, wake up.

09:46.670 --> 09:47.100
Master.

09:48.540 --> 09:49.210
Master.

09:49.670 --> 09:50.180
Master?

10:07.440 --> 10:07.980
Zhang Qishan,

10:09.230 --> 10:10.020
what are you doing?

10:10.520 --> 10:11.260
By order of my superiors,

10:12.430 --> 10:14.300
the Mystic Nine are to be purged at once

10:14.960 --> 10:15.940
for gathering forces to rebel

10:16.200 --> 10:17.050
and compromising city defenses.

10:18.280 --> 10:19.130
Execute them on the spot!

10:19.340 --> 10:21.020
[United in Defending the Realm]

10:29.790 --> 10:32.220
- Master! - Laogou!

10:32.510 --> 10:32.980
Laogou!

10:33.510 --> 10:35.580
- Master, wake up! - Master!

10:35.610 --> 10:36.580
- Laogou! - Master!

10:37.120 --> 10:37.820
Laogou.

10:38.200 --> 10:38.650
Master.

10:38.750 --> 10:39.300
Master!

10:42.750 --> 10:43.250
I...

10:44.390 --> 10:46.100
I don't think Master's heart is beating.

10:47.440 --> 10:47.970
Laogou?

10:48.200 --> 10:49.520
- Master, wake up! - Master!

10:49.520 --> 10:50.300
- Laogou! - Wake up!

10:50.320 --> 10:50.820
Master!

10:50.840 --> 10:51.500
- Laogou! - Wake up, Master!

10:51.500 --> 10:52.260
- Master! - Master!

10:52.260 --> 10:53.520
- Laogou. - Master!

11:12.510 --> 11:15.250
It worked on Wu Laogou.

11:16.720 --> 11:17.730
Liven it up.

11:23.720 --> 11:25.530
- Laogou... - Master...

11:29.510 --> 11:29.980
Laogou!

11:38.000 --> 11:38.530
Laogou!

11:39.630 --> 11:40.490
Laogou!

11:50.510 --> 11:51.010
Laogou!

11:51.510 --> 11:52.010
Laogou!

11:52.960 --> 11:55.060
- Master. - Laogou.

11:55.130 --> 11:56.280
Master!

11:57.550 --> 11:58.170
Laogou.

11:59.630 --> 12:00.100
Master.

12:01.510 --> 12:02.010
Master.

12:03.840 --> 12:06.610
- Master! - Master!

12:08.530 --> 12:09.310
Laogou.

12:11.600 --> 12:12.100
Master.

12:34.720 --> 12:35.130
Master.

12:50.120 --> 12:50.980
I understand now.

12:52.280 --> 12:54.170
You kept forcing me to use this trick

12:54.360 --> 12:55.900
so I would see the future,

12:55.920 --> 12:56.490
didn't you?

12:57.430 --> 12:58.140
Answer me!

12:59.760 --> 13:00.380
Am I right?

13:04.350 --> 13:04.740
Master...

13:06.920 --> 13:07.330
Let's go!

13:08.710 --> 13:10.010
- Master. - Master.

13:36.280 --> 13:37.370
This is the spot.

13:40.560 --> 13:41.160
Master,

13:41.600 --> 13:43.730
did you really see the future?

13:44.280 --> 13:44.770
Break it down.

13:46.150 --> 13:46.500
Yes.

14:11.110 --> 14:12.220
I hear something, Master.

14:12.520 --> 14:13.060
Dogs are barking.

14:13.270 --> 14:14.140
It sounds like Cai and the others.

14:14.520 --> 14:15.220
Keep going.

14:15.520 --> 14:15.840
Yes.

14:39.440 --> 14:39.890
Master,

14:41.030 --> 14:42.340
you really saw the future!

14:43.190 --> 14:44.500
That trick worked!

14:44.990 --> 14:45.340
Master,

14:46.110 --> 14:47.170
there really is a passage.

14:47.880 --> 14:48.970
Should we try going through?

14:49.720 --> 14:50.940
If there really is a passage,

14:51.800 --> 14:52.370
that proves

14:53.320 --> 14:54.890
what I just saw was real too.

15:01.800 --> 15:03.290
That's the truth you were trying to tell me.

15:04.430 --> 15:05.500
Am I right?

15:06.680 --> 15:07.370
Answer me!

15:14.150 --> 15:14.740
Laogou,

15:15.760 --> 15:17.020
what exactly did you see?

15:18.710 --> 15:19.340
I

15:20.990 --> 15:21.970
saw Zhang Qishan

15:23.680 --> 15:25.060
kill everyone in the Mystic Nine.

15:33.710 --> 15:35.090
This tower is unfathomably strange.

15:36.640 --> 15:39.020
What you saw might not be real.

15:39.590 --> 15:41.130
It might be trying to turn us against each other.

15:42.830 --> 15:43.250
Laogou,

15:44.150 --> 15:45.500
you need to calm down. Do you understand?

15:45.870 --> 15:46.290
Laogou,

15:46.710 --> 15:47.250
stay calm.

15:48.750 --> 15:49.650
The position of Changsha Defense Commander.

15:50.600 --> 15:51.530
You take Mondays, Wednesdays, and Fridays.

15:51.910 --> 15:53.700
I'll take Tuesdays, Thursdays, and Saturdays. How about that?

15:55.790 --> 15:56.300
Agreed.

16:06.960 --> 16:08.130
Master Zhang of the Mystic Nine.

16:14.560 --> 16:15.380
Execute them on the spot!

16:16.600 --> 16:17.530
We shouldn't split up.

16:18.150 --> 16:18.820
Stay close.

16:20.510 --> 16:22.180
We may not be able to change the world,

16:23.390 --> 16:24.730
but I hope that one day,

16:25.870 --> 16:27.940
we'll all be masters of our own fate.

16:29.320 --> 16:29.770
Laogou,

16:30.440 --> 16:31.300
Zhang Qishan and the Mystic Nine

16:31.320 --> 16:32.490
have always been your inner demons.

16:33.030 --> 16:33.730
Hold yourself together.

16:35.000 --> 16:35.580
Inner demons...

16:37.320 --> 16:38.100
Xiangu,

16:38.440 --> 16:39.340
do you have any?

16:41.000 --> 16:42.770
Has this tower told you anything?

16:55.550 --> 16:56.850
Then I'll ask him myself.

16:57.670 --> 16:58.770
One look into his eyes will tell me

16:59.750 --> 17:01.100
whether it's my inner demons at work

17:01.670 --> 17:02.940
or something destined to happen.

17:04.590 --> 17:05.250
What about this passage?

17:07.110 --> 17:08.700
Once I've confirmed whether the prophecy is true,

17:09.550 --> 17:10.420
I'll know

17:12.030 --> 17:13.220
whether this is the way out.

17:15.750 --> 17:16.660
- Master. - Master.

17:26.310 --> 17:27.860
You can all wait here for me.

17:29.510 --> 17:30.700
If everything this tower showed me

17:30.720 --> 17:31.380
is true,

17:31.960 --> 17:33.730
I'll take Zhang Qishan down with me.

17:35.160 --> 17:35.660
Then

17:36.880 --> 17:37.570
you can leave

17:37.590 --> 17:38.770
through this passage.

17:39.310 --> 17:39.770
Master,

17:40.400 --> 17:41.380
when Sun Wukong storms the Thunderclap Monastery,

17:41.400 --> 17:42.290
how could he go all alone?

17:42.510 --> 17:43.490
Exactly, Master.

17:45.310 --> 17:46.050
I'll go with you.

17:54.400 --> 17:55.660
I have no interest in Zhang Qishan.

17:56.310 --> 17:56.900
As I told you,

17:57.400 --> 17:58.420
I came down for my own reasons.

17:59.640 --> 18:00.620
Since you promised to help me,

18:01.750 --> 18:02.900
don't be so intent on dying.

18:03.590 --> 18:03.980
Perhaps

18:05.200 --> 18:06.730
there's more than one way out.

18:12.030 --> 18:12.330
All right.

18:14.920 --> 18:15.810
Then let's make a promise

18:18.030 --> 18:18.860
to leave together.

18:29.300 --> 18:31.300
[Nine]

18:35.550 --> 18:36.730
Zhang Qishan really is on the other side.

18:37.680 --> 18:38.010
Let's go.

18:40.500 --> 18:41.540
[Taisho Type 92 Heavy Grenade Discharger]

18:51.160 --> 18:51.420
Master,

18:52.000 --> 18:53.180
we can confirm the transmissions are automated.

18:53.750 --> 18:55.330
There should be an automatic transmitter below,

18:55.640 --> 18:56.490
sending a telegram once a day.

18:56.920 --> 18:57.900
And the batteries

18:58.160 --> 18:59.180
can last a very long time.

19:00.110 --> 19:00.530
Good.

19:02.070 --> 19:03.180
Dead or alive,

19:03.750 --> 19:05.420
Yoshiyuki Hatoyama is down there.

19:07.640 --> 19:08.090
Master,

19:08.960 --> 19:10.250
should we try contacting him,

19:10.550 --> 19:11.570
pretend to be the Japanese sent to meet him,

19:11.920 --> 19:12.380
and trick him?

19:13.110 --> 19:14.250
He won't fall for it so easily.

19:15.510 --> 19:16.570
He must be

19:16.590 --> 19:17.490
an extremely cautious man.

19:19.350 --> 19:20.180
These telegrams

19:21.030 --> 19:21.770
could be a trap.

19:22.590 --> 19:23.050
Don't act rashly.

19:24.000 --> 19:24.330
Understood.

19:29.310 --> 19:29.730
Master Zhang,

19:30.400 --> 19:31.490
that's Laogou's whistle.

19:32.510 --> 19:33.090
Keep searching.

19:39.150 --> 19:39.970
It really is Laogou.

19:40.800 --> 19:41.250
Laogou,

19:41.910 --> 19:42.990
you have no idea.

19:43.230 --> 19:44.650
Master Zhang just made a major discovery...

19:51.230 --> 19:51.660
What's wrong?

19:52.840 --> 19:53.540
Zhang Qishan,

19:54.910 --> 19:55.610
have you ever thought

19:55.630 --> 19:56.380
about killing the Mystic Nine?

20:03.070 --> 20:03.500
Laogou,

20:04.000 --> 20:04.890
what are you talking about?

20:06.190 --> 20:06.620
Have you

20:07.920 --> 20:08.620
or haven't you?

20:11.750 --> 20:13.410
The Mystic Nine remain a threat.

20:13.790 --> 20:14.850
They must be eliminated sooner or later.

20:15.750 --> 20:16.490
When the time comes,

20:17.000 --> 20:18.700
you must do it yourself.

20:27.510 --> 20:28.090
So,

20:30.150 --> 20:30.810
you really have thought

20:30.830 --> 20:31.490
about it.

20:33.400 --> 20:34.700
Then I wasn't wrong to accuse you.

20:36.150 --> 20:37.610
I'll finish you here today

20:38.160 --> 20:39.500
and rid the Mystic Nine of a menace!

20:53.160 --> 20:53.730
Calm down.

21:08.110 --> 21:09.500
Stop fighting!

21:10.910 --> 21:12.860
"In matters of propriety, harmony is prized!"

21:17.080 --> 21:18.300
The Metal Sha is upon us.

21:18.550 --> 21:19.730
Once weapons are drawn,

21:19.830 --> 21:20.970
blood will be shed!

21:47.110 --> 21:47.530
Don't move,

21:48.920 --> 21:50.010
or I'll kill you.

21:51.110 --> 21:52.340
Either stab me now,

21:53.240 --> 21:54.410
or talk this through.

21:58.080 --> 21:59.250
You know why I

21:59.270 --> 22:00.290
brought you here, right?

22:11.400 --> 22:12.970
You know this tower is not right.

22:14.080 --> 22:15.130
It's targeting us.

22:16.400 --> 22:18.060
It's using our grudges

22:18.710 --> 22:19.660
to turn us against each other.

22:20.550 --> 22:21.180
You're wrong.

22:22.520 --> 22:23.900
You and I became enemies first.

22:24.800 --> 22:25.940
That's what gave it an opening.

22:25.960 --> 22:27.410
We can settle our scores once we're out.

22:31.520 --> 22:32.530
Still the same old tone.

22:34.760 --> 22:36.060
You speak as though you're being reasonable,

22:36.960 --> 22:37.900
but everything you do

22:38.710 --> 22:40.340
serves only your own power and interests.

22:43.550 --> 22:44.460
I was bound by military law.

22:46.080 --> 22:47.410
I had no choice then.

22:48.550 --> 22:50.340
Shouldn't we put the greater good first?

22:50.550 --> 22:51.250
The greater good?

22:52.270 --> 22:54.090
Your so-called greater good

22:54.680 --> 22:55.340
has never had

22:55.360 --> 22:56.850
room for lowly people like us.

22:58.590 --> 22:59.130
I know.

23:00.400 --> 23:01.570
Officials are officials, and commoners are commoners.

23:01.760 --> 23:03.290
A lowly outfit like the Mystic Nine

23:03.430 --> 23:05.500
will always be cannon fodder for people like you!

23:08.800 --> 23:10.340
Sooner or later, we'll die by your hands,

23:11.400 --> 23:11.900
won't we?

23:13.590 --> 23:14.500
Then what do you want?

23:16.920 --> 23:17.970
I want to live.

23:18.830 --> 23:20.010
I want food on the table

23:20.080 --> 23:21.340
and the chance to live with dignity.

23:24.360 --> 23:25.900
The greater good was never what we wanted.

23:26.480 --> 23:27.530
Without the greater good,

23:29.110 --> 23:30.460
would any of us survive?

23:33.960 --> 23:35.220
You may not know this, Master Zhang,

23:36.870 --> 23:37.940
but lowly people like us

23:38.710 --> 23:40.340
never gave up even in the hardest years.

23:41.800 --> 23:43.220
We survived

23:43.240 --> 23:44.290
on slop and tree bark.

23:45.640 --> 23:46.740
Leave the Mystic Nine to me.

23:47.590 --> 23:49.220
I can keep everyone alive

23:50.000 --> 23:51.010
without relying on you.

23:53.470 --> 23:54.940
I've lived through everything

23:55.520 --> 23:56.420
you speak of.

23:58.880 --> 24:00.250
You want everyone to survive,

24:02.120 --> 24:03.860
but with what little the Mystic Nine can do,

24:04.670 --> 24:05.650
how many can you protect?

24:07.350 --> 24:08.810
Perhaps you can save the few people

24:09.640 --> 24:10.450
with you now.

24:11.520 --> 24:12.210
But what if there are more?

24:12.760 --> 24:14.380
What if there are ten or a hundred times as many?

24:14.640 --> 24:16.890
And will sacrificing the Mystic Nine really save that many people?

24:19.320 --> 24:20.180
Do you remember

24:21.350 --> 24:22.540
what happened at the mine?

24:23.940 --> 24:28.020
[The mine, several years ago]

24:40.640 --> 24:41.450
Don't panic!

24:41.910 --> 24:42.690
Watch your step.

24:43.520 --> 24:44.450
Leave as quickly as you can.

24:45.030 --> 24:46.570
The rest of you, follow me.

24:47.760 --> 24:48.740
Thank you, Master Zhang.

24:49.590 --> 24:50.770
Thank you for saving us, Master Zhang.

24:50.790 --> 24:51.650
Thank you, Master Zhang.

24:52.320 --> 24:53.740
Thank you, Master Zhang.

24:53.910 --> 24:55.300
Thank you, Master Zhang.

24:55.990 --> 24:57.060
Thank you, Master Zhang.

24:57.150 --> 24:57.620
Hurry.

24:58.790 --> 24:59.250
Xiaoyu,

25:00.230 --> 25:01.300
have them search in separate groups

25:01.830 --> 25:02.980
and bring me the mine owner.

25:03.440 --> 25:03.860
Yes.

25:27.030 --> 25:28.100
We're here to rescue people today,

25:28.670 --> 25:29.620
not to fight a battle.

25:30.880 --> 25:31.650
Lower your guns.

25:32.120 --> 25:32.860
Don't frighten the civilians.

25:33.790 --> 25:34.650
Guard the explosives depot closely.

25:35.320 --> 25:36.060
Seal the detonators separately.

25:36.670 --> 25:38.650
There must not be a single spark tonight.

25:38.760 --> 25:39.210
Yes, sir!

25:40.400 --> 25:41.380
Zhang Qishan.

25:42.960 --> 25:44.420
Master Zhang of the Mystic Nine.

25:46.150 --> 25:47.300
Is everyone out?

25:47.470 --> 25:48.450
Hurry and leave!

25:50.000 --> 25:50.980
There are still people inside.

25:51.350 --> 25:52.100
I know these tunnels.

25:52.320 --> 25:53.130
Let's go rescue them.

25:54.400 --> 25:54.980
We...

25:55.080 --> 25:56.450
We don't have Master Zhang's skills.

25:56.670 --> 25:58.380
We're lucky just to make it out alive.

25:58.440 --> 25:59.450
- Run for your life! - Go!

25:59.520 --> 26:00.620
- Save yourself! - Hurry.

26:00.760 --> 26:01.650
- What's there to fear? - Leave.

26:01.830 --> 26:02.940
Master Zhang is still here!

26:03.270 --> 26:03.650
Master Zhang,

26:04.120 --> 26:04.890
an urgent telegram from the Ministry of War.

26:05.270 --> 26:06.500
The troops are ordered to withdraw at once

26:06.670 --> 26:07.690
for an important mission.

26:08.400 --> 26:09.860
Xiaoyu, wrap things up quickly.

26:10.320 --> 26:11.420
Take the others back first.

26:12.080 --> 26:12.540
Yes.

26:21.590 --> 26:22.770
Account for everyone,

26:23.000 --> 26:23.750
then evacuate immediately.

26:24.230 --> 26:26.300
Take all these overseers back to Defense Headquarters.

26:26.560 --> 26:26.980
Yes.

26:29.230 --> 26:29.740
Master...

26:29.910 --> 26:30.650
Mind your injuries.

26:30.760 --> 26:31.320
Move.

26:35.550 --> 26:36.420
Master Zhang!

26:36.550 --> 26:37.290
Master Zhang!

26:37.400 --> 26:38.530
There are still people inside!

26:43.920 --> 26:44.900
Those in lofty halls sit too high

26:45.790 --> 26:46.980
to hear the voices of ordinary people.

26:48.030 --> 26:49.570
That's why evil runs rampant.

26:53.030 --> 26:54.570
There were only a few hundred people.

26:56.030 --> 26:57.090
Just a few hundred.

26:58.960 --> 27:00.660
Yet you couldn't hear my voice.

27:01.510 --> 27:03.180
You couldn't hear me!

27:05.790 --> 27:07.250
I had no better choice.

27:10.440 --> 27:12.090
I need you to give me some time.

27:12.960 --> 27:13.730
Once we're out,

27:14.550 --> 27:15.860
I'll settle this.

27:16.440 --> 27:17.900
But right now, there's something more important.

27:17.920 --> 27:18.620
Just shut your mouth...

27:18.640 --> 27:19.180
Listen!

27:19.550 --> 27:20.900
There are Japanese in this tower!

27:27.200 --> 27:27.660
What?

27:28.800 --> 27:31.380
They stopped at nothing to infiltrate Changsha

27:32.280 --> 27:33.220
and enter the Otherworld Tower.

27:34.990 --> 27:36.690
Unless we find out what they're planning,

27:37.000 --> 27:38.340
when they attack Changsha,

27:39.920 --> 27:41.090
the high officials

27:41.110 --> 27:41.690
and commoners alike

27:41.710 --> 27:42.930
will all die.

27:46.470 --> 27:47.130
Laogou,

27:48.880 --> 27:50.180
I need your help.

27:52.560 --> 27:53.740
Help me find my troops

27:54.790 --> 27:56.260
and uncover the Japanese military's plot.

27:57.040 --> 27:57.810
Once we're out,

27:59.040 --> 28:00.290
I'll leave the Mystic Nine.

28:12.030 --> 28:13.690
We've found their base.

28:14.670 --> 28:16.100
The Japanese have been here for a long time.

28:17.950 --> 28:19.690
They seem to be deep beneath this place,

28:20.560 --> 28:22.180
searching for something of immense importance.

28:24.120 --> 28:25.460
I want you to go down there with me.

28:30.710 --> 28:31.820
Perhaps you've forgotten, Master Zhang,

28:33.840 --> 28:35.850
but I only agreed to help you find Unit 401,

28:37.710 --> 28:38.940
not the Japanese.

28:41.510 --> 28:42.050
Still,

28:43.280 --> 28:44.690
after what you just said,

28:45.280 --> 28:46.460
I believe there's a one-in-ten chance

28:46.480 --> 28:47.300
that you'll protect the Mystic Nine.

28:50.320 --> 28:51.690
I'll bet on that chance.

28:54.350 --> 28:55.100
I'll help you.

29:00.480 --> 29:01.100
Stop arguing!

29:01.150 --> 29:03.380
Quiet! What's all this fighting about?

29:04.230 --> 29:05.380
You're all members of the Mystic Nine.

29:05.990 --> 29:07.540
Why are you fighting among yourselves?

29:08.430 --> 29:10.490
Whatever the issue is, talk it through.

29:11.040 --> 29:12.740
Once everything is clear, you can fight

29:12.990 --> 29:14.610
if you still want to. Isn't that right?

29:16.120 --> 29:16.970
- Master Zhang. - Master Zhang.

29:16.990 --> 29:17.840
- Master Zhang, are you all right?
- Fifth Master, are you all right?

29:17.840 --> 29:18.500
Are you hurt?

29:21.150 --> 29:22.210
Put your weapons away.

29:23.560 --> 29:24.330
Put them away.

29:26.230 --> 29:27.100
Well, it seems

29:27.840 --> 29:29.300
you two have made peace.

29:32.510 --> 29:33.660
That's wonderful.

29:35.040 --> 29:35.570
Master Zhang,

29:36.840 --> 29:37.540
as agreed,

29:38.310 --> 29:38.820
let's continue.

29:39.240 --> 29:39.940
You're a man of honor.

29:55.480 --> 29:56.620
Aside from these men who committed seppuku,

29:57.550 --> 30:00.180
some of the Japanese must have gone down the shaft,

30:00.750 --> 30:02.140
including Yoshiyuki Hatoyama.

30:04.550 --> 30:05.900
That was years ago.

30:07.030 --> 30:07.810
Anyone down there

30:08.750 --> 30:09.700
should be long dead by now.

30:11.440 --> 30:13.700
These men may be dead,

30:14.680 --> 30:16.620
but other Japanese surely haven't given up.

30:17.720 --> 30:19.090
Unit 401's disappearance

30:20.000 --> 30:20.700
must be connected

30:20.720 --> 30:22.180
to why Hatoyama came down here years ago.

30:28.880 --> 30:29.460
Juanlian,

30:29.880 --> 30:30.530
get things ready.

30:30.790 --> 30:31.730
Let's get down there quickly.

30:33.310 --> 30:33.700
Yes.

30:50.000 --> 30:50.460
Laogou.

30:51.440 --> 30:51.900
Laogou.

30:53.960 --> 30:55.770
What exactly did you and Master Zhang talk about?

30:56.830 --> 30:58.330
The two of you are willing to work together now.

30:59.030 --> 31:00.090
Does that mean

31:00.680 --> 31:01.770
you've made peace?

31:03.240 --> 31:03.700
I don't want it.

31:04.030 --> 31:04.460
I'm not hungry.

31:04.920 --> 31:05.620
If you don't eat it now,

31:05.790 --> 31:06.660
you may not get another chance.

31:08.070 --> 31:09.010
What do you mean?

31:12.590 --> 31:13.290
See that?

31:15.720 --> 31:17.460
All those Japanese have already kicked the bucket.

31:18.310 --> 31:19.660
No one knows what's waiting for us

31:20.000 --> 31:21.050
down there.

31:22.550 --> 31:23.620
If you eat now,

31:24.200 --> 31:25.620
at least you won't meet

31:26.030 --> 31:27.140
the Underworld King

31:28.000 --> 31:28.660
on an empty stomach.

31:29.550 --> 31:30.460
Enough...

31:31.960 --> 31:32.900
Honestly, Laogou,

31:33.200 --> 31:35.050
you really have a vicious tongue.

31:36.510 --> 31:37.180
I'm telling you,

31:37.480 --> 31:39.490
if you ever scare me to death,

31:40.030 --> 31:42.380
no one else in the Mystic Nine will treat you this well.

31:43.240 --> 31:43.810
Unbelievable.

31:56.500 --> 32:01.020
[Hurry]

32:04.680 --> 32:05.930
You'll see many things

32:05.930 --> 32:07.730
beyond your imagination.

32:10.160 --> 32:11.140
At crucial moments,

32:12.550 --> 32:15.460
be one step ahead of Zhang Qishan and Wu Laogou.

32:45.550 --> 32:48.460
This shaft was so carefully concealed.

32:48.750 --> 32:50.570
It must be the only way down.

32:52.310 --> 32:54.770
Yin Changsheng's secret may well lie below.

32:55.880 --> 32:57.420
According to the notes,

32:57.960 --> 33:00.010
this shaft should be 600 meters deep.

33:00.480 --> 33:01.420
Six hundred meters?

33:04.240 --> 33:04.700
Master Zhang,

33:05.350 --> 33:06.700
how long will it take us to reach the bottom?

33:09.070 --> 33:10.860
If the records kept by the Japanese are accurate,

33:12.270 --> 33:12.860
down there

33:13.750 --> 33:15.290
lies the very heart of the Underworld,

33:16.720 --> 33:18.460
which means it is extremely dangerous.

33:21.000 --> 33:22.290
We must proceed

33:23.000 --> 33:23.810
with utmost caution.

33:25.350 --> 33:26.570
The men up here are dead,

33:27.440 --> 33:29.220
but we don't know what's waiting below.

33:35.830 --> 33:36.380
Master Zhang,

33:37.350 --> 33:39.980
let's take the lead this time.

33:45.200 --> 33:46.700
If Unit 401 really is down there,

33:47.440 --> 33:48.700
things will only get more complicated.

33:49.480 --> 33:51.380
Whatever happens, don't fire.

33:59.880 --> 34:00.290
Xiangu!

34:01.240 --> 34:01.980
Xiangu!

34:09.070 --> 34:10.380
Why did Miss Huo go down alone?

34:16.840 --> 34:18.690
What did Ding tell you?

34:19.360 --> 34:20.570
He wanted me to go down as his spy

34:21.510 --> 34:23.980
to find out what was happening below.

34:32.480 --> 34:33.050
Juanlian, Tianpeng,

34:33.630 --> 34:34.300
come down with me.

34:35.070 --> 34:35.650
The other three

34:36.150 --> 34:36.940
stay here.

34:37.280 --> 34:37.650
Yes.

34:38.150 --> 34:38.610
Master...

34:53.800 --> 34:54.860
Why is it so misty?

34:55.070 --> 34:56.300
It must be very cold below.

35:11.360 --> 35:11.740
Tiezui.

35:22.550 --> 35:23.010
Master Zhang,

35:23.800 --> 35:24.860
these carvings

35:25.320 --> 35:26.820
tell the story of Yin Changsheng's life.

35:30.760 --> 35:31.690
There's another one here.

35:33.030 --> 35:33.860
This one

35:34.550 --> 35:35.860
is about this shaft.

35:36.230 --> 35:36.570
Wait.

35:37.230 --> 35:38.210
This shaft

35:38.920 --> 35:40.130
has a name of its own.

35:41.590 --> 35:44.010
Yin Changsheng was so fond of it

35:45.000 --> 35:45.940
that he treated it like a pet.

35:48.030 --> 35:49.170
He even gave it a name:

35:50.150 --> 35:50.980
Luotian.

35:59.000 --> 35:59.940
A shaft as a pet?

36:01.000 --> 36:02.530
I've heard Westerners speak of lunatics like that.

36:02.840 --> 36:03.940
Exactly.

36:04.590 --> 36:05.490
I need to light some incense

36:05.880 --> 36:06.900
to check the airflow.

36:18.960 --> 36:20.530
Don't bother, Tiezui.

36:21.110 --> 36:21.940
Let's keep going down.

36:38.710 --> 36:39.090
Wait.

37:02.710 --> 37:03.460
This is a Japanese soldier.

37:04.030 --> 37:04.780
How did he die here?

37:12.190 --> 37:12.900
No external wounds.

37:13.920 --> 37:14.900
He must have died suddenly.

37:36.540 --> 37:37.820
[Infantry]

37:49.740 --> 37:51.140
[Top-Secret Special Transfer Order]

37:51.360 --> 37:52.260
What does it say?

37:52.630 --> 37:53.570
The transfer order says

37:54.280 --> 37:56.460
this man was assigned to Changsha

37:57.280 --> 37:58.490
to take part in Operation Catch All.

37:59.070 --> 38:00.130
All operations were

38:00.630 --> 38:02.360
to be carried out under Yoshiyuki Hatoyama's command.

38:02.550 --> 38:03.940
So Hatoyama came here

38:05.840 --> 38:06.820
to carry out

38:06.840 --> 38:08.340
this so-called Operation Catch All.

38:11.000 --> 38:12.300
Operation Catch All?

38:12.800 --> 38:13.940
What is that about?

38:15.110 --> 38:16.530
And what does it have to do with this Underworld?

38:42.900 --> 38:47.060
♪The past fades like smoke♪

38:47.420 --> 38:50.140
♪A choice is made in silence♪

38:50.420 --> 38:53.220
♪In this labyrinthine puzzle♪

38:53.620 --> 38:57.380
♪Who can reach the shore?♪

38:57.620 --> 39:01.060
♪Just an ordinary farewell♪

39:01.340 --> 39:04.740
♪The sun seems to shine bright over our heads♪

39:04.820 --> 39:12.100
♪But this could be our last trip together♪

39:12.540 --> 39:15.820
♪The spring breeze continues outside♪

39:16.100 --> 39:19.340
♪Who was it who left in such haste?♪

39:19.500 --> 39:23.540
♪Caught in the game, the raging waves fall silent♪

39:23.740 --> 39:27.100
♪Who believes in fate?♪

39:27.340 --> 39:30.700
♪For my home and my country, the years pass like a dream♪

39:30.940 --> 39:34.220
♪When the song ends, who will still be waiting?♪

39:34.540 --> 39:38.220
♪With a nod, we bid farewell and set out again♪

39:38.420 --> 39:41.660
♪Take care♪

39:41.660 --> 39:44.220
♪We once raced♪

39:44.300 --> 39:46.220
♪For the dawn♪

39:46.380 --> 39:49.660
♪Ever-lasting bond, a satisfying vindication♪

39:49.780 --> 39:53.060
♪In the web of fate♪

39:53.060 --> 39:56.260
♪No one can escape♪

39:57.260 --> 39:59.100
♪Life and death cut like a blade♪

39:59.260 --> 40:00.820
♪We too were young once♪

40:00.900 --> 40:04.340
♪Fortunate to brave the raging waves together♪

40:04.540 --> 40:06.860
♪Keep the ember lit♪

40:06.980 --> 40:11.500
♪To illuminate the journey ahead♪

40:11.620 --> 40:14.580
♪The spring breeze continues outside♪

40:14.820 --> 40:18.340
♪Who was it who left in such haste?♪

40:18.460 --> 40:22.220
♪Caught in the game, the raging waves fall silent♪

40:22.540 --> 40:26.020
♪Who believes in fate?♪

40:26.180 --> 40:29.180
♪For my home and my country, the years pass like a dream♪

40:29.420 --> 40:33.180
♪When the song ends, who will still be waiting?♪

40:33.340 --> 40:37.060
♪With a nod, we bid farewell and set out again♪

40:37.180 --> 40:48.620
♪Please, do take care of yourself♪
